Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(app): refusals say what a setup owns in plain words,
 not "furniture"

Five user-visible refusals (repair, update, setup name, reserved names
for setups and tools) said "furniture", our in-code word. They now name
the setup's stock, work offsets or fixtures. Same conditions, same
commands; a guard test keeps the word out of these refusals.

Fixes #878

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
